# Vite bakes these at BUILD time — rebuild after changing.

# ── Behind the shared nginx front door (recommended / integrated) ──
# App served at /inventory-app/; both APIs are same-origin (nginx proxies them).
# Behind the shared nginx front door (https://<host>/inventory-app/):
VITE_BASE_PATH=/inventory-app/
VITE_API_BASE=/inventory-api/api/v1
VITE_KALNOSTICS_API_BASE=/kalnostics-api/api/v1
# (base path defaults to /inventory-app/ in vite.config.ts)

# ── Standalone local dev (no nginx; hit the apps directly) ──
# Standalone/local dev instead: VITE_BASE_PATH=/
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:3100/api/v1
# VITE_KALNOSTICS_API_BASE=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
